card.text:
When Thieves' Tools enters the battlefield, create a Treasure token. (It's an artifact with "{T}, Sacrifice this token: Add one mana of any color.")
Equipped creature can't be blocked as long as its power is 3 or less.
Equip {2}

Equipped creature gets +1/+0.
Whenever equipped creature deals combat damage to a player, create a Treasure token. (It's an artifact with "{T}, Sacrifice this token: Add one mana of any color.")
Equip {2}

Whenever equipped creature deals combat damage to a player, take an extra turn after this one.
Equipped creature can't attack during extra turns.
Equip {2}{U}

Whenever Mobile Scarf becomes attached to a creature for the first time each turn, draw a card.
Equipped creature can't be blocked.
Equip {U}{U}

Whenever Fickle Ribbon becomes attached to a creature for the first time each turn, draw a card.
Whenever equipped creature attacks, it gets +3/+0 and gains deathtouch until end of turn.
Equip {B}{B}

Whenever Coalition Scarf becomes attached to a creature for the first time each turn, draw a card.
Whenever equipped creature attacks, creatures you control get +1/+1.
Equip {W}{W}

Whenever Explosive Band becomes attached to a creature for the first time each turn, draw a card.
Whenever equipped creature is dealt damage, it deals that much damage to any target.
Equip {R}{R}

Whenever Fierce Bandanna becomes attached to a creature for the first time each turn, draw a card.
Equipped creature gets +1/+1 and has trample.
Equip {G}{G}

Whenever equipped creature attacks, prepare it once for each of its colors. (If it's a leveler, put a level counter on it. Otherwise, put a +1/+1 counter on it.)
As long as equipped creature is named Jacob, Memory Seeker, it is all colors.
Equip {2}
